  <para style="h">Kalesia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ñwed Nditọ Kalesia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kalesia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kal</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ñwed Ndito Kalesia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Ñwed emi oto Pọl emi ikot esie ndidi isuñutom ikotoho ke owo, ikonyuñ ibehe ke ubọk owo, edi okoto Jisọs Kraist, ye Abasi Ete, emi ekemenerede enye osio ke ñkpa. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Kpukpru mme nditọ ete emi edude mi ye ami edian uyo ke ndinọ ekọm esọk ufọk Abasi ke Kalesia. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Yak Abasi Ete ñnyin ye Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist ọnọ mbufo mfọn ye emem. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Man ekeme ndifak ñnyin nsio ke oburobut emana emi, Kraist ama ayak uwem esie ọnọ ke ibuot mme idiọkñkpọ ñnyin ke ndisuk ibuot nnọ uduak Abasi ye Ete ñnyin. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Ubọñ enyene Abasi ke nsinsi nsinsi Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eti Mbuk Efen Iduhọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Idem akpa mi ye mbufo, nte ibighike bighi, mbufo emedadiañade nsaña ye enyemi okokotde mbufo oto ke mfọn Kraist, ndien ebine uduot ukwọrọ ikọ efen. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Ke editim ntiñ, uduot Eti Mbuk efen iduhọ, edi ami ntiñ emi, koro mme ndusuk owo edu emi eñwanade nditimede mbufo man ekpuhọrede eti etop Kraist.<verse eid="GAL 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ekpededi ñnyin mme mme enjel eto enyọñ edikwọrọ eti etop emi ọkpuhọrede ọkpọñ enye emi ñnyin ikọkwọrọde inọ mbufo, yak emia enye ufen ke nsinsi ke ikañ ndutuhọ. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Ñnyin ima itetiñ akpa, ami mfiak ntọñọ ntak ntiñ, nte edieke owo baba kiet ọkwọrọde mbuk efen emi ọkpuhọrede ọkpọñ eti mbuk emi mbufo ekenyimede enyuñ ebọde eto ñnyin, yak emia enye ufen ke ikañ ndutuhọ.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Nte emi owut nte ami ññwana ndibọ edinyime nto owo? Baba! Ami ñyom unyime Abasi. Nte ami ññwana nte mme owo ediọñọde mi? Edieke ami ñkpakade iso ndinam ntre, ami ñkpedighe isuñutom Kraist.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Yak ami ntiñ nnọ mbufo, nditọ ete mi, nte, ke Eti Mbuk emi ami ñkọkwọrọde idighe ñkpọ emi ubọk owo akanamde. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Ami ñkọbọhọ nto baba owo ndomokiet, inyuñ inyeneke nte owo baba kiet ekekpepde mi. Ekedi Jisọs Kraist ke idem esie akayarade ọnọ mi.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Ema etiñ enọ mbufo ebaña usuñ emi ñkodude uwem kini emi ami ñkanamde akpanikọ ye ido ukpono mme Ju, nte ami ñkọkọbọde ufọk Abasi Kraist, ñkekopke mbọm, ñkenyuñ nnamde kpukpru se ñkekekeme ndibiat enye nsio. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Ami ñkedi adaiso ke otu ubọk ñka mi, emi edide Ju, ke edinam ñkpọ nnọ ido ukpono mme Ju. Ami mma nsin ifik eti eti ke edinam mme ido emana mme ete ete ñnyin.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Edi Abasi, ke akwa mfọn Esie, ama emek mi mbemiso ami mmana onyuñ okot mi ndinam ñkpọ nnọ Enye, ndien Enye ama ebiere <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />ndiyarade Eyen esie nnọ mi, man oto do ami ñkwọrọ Eti Mbuk emi abañade Enye nnọ mme mmọ emi midighe ubon mme Ju, ami ñkakaha ebiet ndomokiet ñkọbọ item.<verse eid="GAL 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Mme ami ndika Jerusalem ñkekut mme mmọ oro ekebemde mi iso edi mme mbet, edi ami mma ndaha inikiet ñka ke obio Arabia ebiet emi ami ñkotode mfiak ndi obio Damaskọs. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Ekedi ke ñkpọ nte isua ita ama ekebe ke ami ñkeka Jerusalem ndibọ item nto Pita, ndien ami ñkodu ye enye ke ñkpọ nte urua iba. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Ami ñkekwe mbet ndomokiet efen ke ebede Jems, eyen eka Ọbọñ. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Ami ntiñ emi ke iso Abasi nnọ mbufo nte se ami ñwetde emi idighe nsu. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ekem, ami mma ñka ke mme ebiet ke obio Siria ye ke Silisia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Ke ini oro, mme mbon ufọk Abasi Kraist ke Judia ikediọñọke mi. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Mmọ ekekop etop emi ekedọhọde ete, “owo oro ọkọkọbọde ñnyin ke ọkwọrọ mbuọtidem emi enye akañwanade ndibiat idaha emi.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Ndien, mmọ ema etoro Abasi ke ntak mi.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Ke isua duopenañ ama ekebe ami mma mfiak ñka Jerusalem ye Banabas, mma ñnyuñ nda Taitọs asaña ye ñnyin. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Ami ñkaka koro Abasi akayarade ọnọ mi nte ke ana ami ñka. Ke ndibe mbono ye mme adausuñ, ami mma nnam Eti Mbuk emi ñkwọrọde nnọ mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju añwaña mmọ. Ami ñkoyomke utom emi ami ñkanamde ke edem mme emi ami ñkade iso ndinam idahaemi ewọrọ ikpuikpu. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Okposukedi emi Taitọs emi edide nsaña mi ekedide eyen Krik, owo ikenyikke enye ana mbobi.<verse eid="GAL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eneni Emi Abañade Ibet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Mme ndusuk owo emi ekebiañade ete ke mmimọ idi nditọ ete enyuñ ebuaha ke otu ñnyin, ema eyom ndinim enye mbobi. Mme mmọ emi ekededip idem eduk nte mbio uyep ndiyarade ndiọñọ uwọrọufin emi ñnyin inyenede ke edidiana ñnyin kiet ye Kraist Jisọs. Mmọ ekeyom ndida ñnyin nsin ufin. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Ñnyin ikenyimeke inọ mmọ ndomo esisit, man ikeme ndimum Eti Mbuk emi nnim nte ọfọnde ama nnọ mbufo.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Edi mme mmọ emi eketiede nte mme adaiso, se mmọ ekedide ikenyeneke ñkpọ ndinam ye ami, Abasi ibiereke itiene nte ñnyin itiede ke enyọñ idem, mme adaiso emi ikadianke baba obufa ñkpọ kiet ke etop mi. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Edi mmọ ema ekut ete ke Abasi ama ọnọ mi ubiọñ edikwọrọ Eti Mbuk emi nnọ mme mmọ emi midighe Ju, kpa nte Enye ọkọnọde Pita ubiọñ edikwọrọ Eti mbuk emi nnọ mme Ju. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Koro ekedi ke odudu Abasi ke ekenam mi isuñutom Abasi enọ mme mmọ emi midighe Ju kpa nte ekenamde Pita isuñutom Abasi enọ mme Ju. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Jems, Pita, ye Jọn emi ekedide mme adaha, ema enyime ete ke Abasi ama ọnọ mi asaña asaña utom emi, ke ntre mmọ ema eda Banabas ye ami nte mme asañautom kiet, ñnyin ima inyime ite ke ñnyin iyenam utom ñnyin ke otu mme mmọ emi midighe Ju ndien mmọ ñko ke otu mme Ju. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Kpukpru se mmọ ekebeñede ekedi, yak ñnyin iti mme mbon unana ke otu mmọ, emi ekedi ukem ukem ñkpọ emi ami ñkenyenede udọñ ndinam.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ke ini emi Pita ekedide ke Antiọk, ami ma nneni ye enye añwa añwa, koro enye ama eneñede edue. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Mbemiso ndusuk mme mmọ emi Jems ọkọdọñde edisim do, Pita ama esidia udia ye mme nditọ ete emi midighe Ju. Edi ke mme mmọ emi ema ekedisim, enye ama afiak edem, inyimeke ndidia aba udia ye mmọ koro enye akabakde mme mmọ oro ekeyirede ete yak enim mmọ emi midighe Ju emi ekenimde ke akpanikọ mbobi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Mme nditọ ete eken emi ekedide mme Ju ema etọñọ ndinam ñkpọ nte mbio mbubik nte Pita tutu esim idem Banabas, ido mbubik ama otuk enye ñko. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Ke ini ami ñkokutde nte ke mmọ ikasañake ke nnen nnen afañ nte asañade ekekem ye akpanikọ Eti Mbuk, ami ma ndọhọ Pita ke iso kpukpru owo emi ekedude nte, “Afo edi Ju, edi afo aka iso ndidu uwem nte owo emi midighe Ju. Didie ndien ke afo ekeme ndinyik mme mmọ emi midighe Ju edu uwem nte mme Ju?” <verse eid="GAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Ke akpanikọ, ñnyin idi mme Ju ke emana, ñnyin idighe mme mmọ emi midighe Ju “mme anam idiọkñkpọ.” <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Edi ñnyin imọdiọñọ ite ke enam owo enen ye Abasi oto ke mbuọtidem ikpọñ ikpọñ ke Jisọs Kraist, idighe ke edinam se ibet etemede. Ñnyin ñko, imọbuọt idem ye Kraist Jisọs man inen ke iso Abasi oto ke mbuọtidem ñnyin ke Kraist, idighe ke edinam se ibet etemede, koro owo baba kiet inenke ke iso Abasi ito ke edinam se ibet etemede.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Edieke ñnyin ndien iñwanade ndinen ye Abasi oto ke edidiana ñnyin ye Kraist, ndien eyarade efiọk ete ke ñnyin idi mme anam idiọkñkpọ ukem ukem nte mmọ emi midighe Ju enamde, nte emi owut ete ke Kraist oduk nsaña ye idiọkñkpọ? Idighe ntre ke ndomo ntak kiet. <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Edieke ami ntọñọde ntak ndibọp se ami ñkewuride, oro owut ete ke ami ndi abiat ibet. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Ke se ededi emi otukde ibet ami mma ñkpa ñwọrọ ke esit, edi idem ibet okowot mi, man otodo ami ndu uwem nnọ Abasi. Ema ewot mi ye Kraist ke Krọs Esie.<verse eid="GAL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Ke ntre, idighe ami aba ndu uwem emi, edi Kraist odu uwem ke ami. Uwem emi ami ndude idaha emi, ami ndu ke mbuọtidem ke Eyen Abasi, emi akamade mi ndien ayak uwem esie ọnọ mi. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Ami nsinke mfọn Abasi. Edieke owo okutde unen ke iso Abasi oto ke edinim ibet, oro ọwọrọ ete ke Kraist akakpa ke ikpuikpu!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mbet Mme Ju Ikemeke Ndinyaña Owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Mbufo ndisime mbon Kalesia! Anie eda odudu efen etimede mbufo? Ke iso mbufo nnen nnen ke ekenam ñkpa Jisọs Kraist ke Krọs eneñede añwaña mbufo. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Etiñ ñkpọ kiet emi enọ mi: nte mbufo ekebọ Spirit Abasi ke edinam se ibet etemede, mme ekedi ke edikop ye ke edinim Eti Mbuk ke akpanikọ? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Mbufo esime didie ndien ntem? Mbufo eketọñọ ke Spirit Abasi; nte mbufo eyom ndien ndiketre ke odudu idem mbufo? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Nte kpukpru mme ifiọk emi mbufo ema ekenyene ọwọrọ ikpuikpu? Ke akpanikọ ewọrọ ñkpọ.<verse eid="GAL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Nte Abasi ọnọ mbufo Spirit Esie onyuñ anam mme utibe ñkpọ ke otu mbufo oto ke emi mbufo ekenamde se ibet etemede, mme ekedi koro mbufo ekekopde enyuñ enim Eti Mbuk ke akpanikọ?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Edi kere baña Ebraham, nte ñwed Abasi etiñde ete, “Enye ama enim Abasi ke akpanikọ, ndien ama oto ke mbuọtidem esie Abasi ama enyime enye nte edinen owo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Mbufo enyene nditim mfiọk emi, ndien, ete ke mme mmọ emi enyenede mbuọtidem edi mme ata nditọ Ebraham.<verse eid="GAL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Ñwed Abasi ama etetiñ enim nte ke Abasi eyenam mme mmọ emi midighe Ju enen ke iso Esie oto ke mbuọtidem. Ke ntre ñwed Abasi ama ọkwọrọ Eti Mbuk ọnọ Ebraham mbemiso esim ini emi ete, “Eyeto ke afo Abasi ọyọdiọñ kpukpru ubon owo ke iso isọñ”. <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Ebraham ama enim ke akpanikọ ndien ema ediọñ enye; kpa ntre, kpukpru mme mmọ emi enimde ke akpanikọ ediọñ mmọ kpa nte ekediọñde enye.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Mme mmọ emi eberide idem ke se ibet Moses etemede edu uwem ke idak isuñi. Koro ñwed Abasi ọdọhọde ete, “Owo ekededi emi minamke kpukpru ini, kpukpru se ewetde ke ñwed ibet odu ke idak isuñi Abasi”. <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Ke emi, etim añwaña nte owo baba kiet inenke ye Abasi ke edinim ibet Moses, koro ñwed Abasi ọdọhọde ete, “Edinen owo edidu uwem ke mbuọtidem.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Edi ibet Moses inyeneke ñkpọ ndinam ye mbuọtidem, nte ñwed Abasi ọdọhọde, ete, “Owo emi anamde kpukpru se ibet etemede eyedu uwem ke mmọ.” <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Edi Kraist ama afak ñnyin osio ke isuñi emi asañade ye ibet Moses, ke emi enye akakabarede edi isuñi ọnọ ñnyin, koro ñwed Abasi ọdọhọ ete, “Owo ekededi emi eyirede ke eto odu ke idak isuñi Abasi.”<verse eid="GAL 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eñwọñọ Abasi Ekebem Iso Edi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Kraist akanam emi man edidiọñ emi Abasi ọkọñwọñọde ọnọ Ebraham ekpebe esim mme mmọ emi midighe Ju, oto ke Kraist Jisọs, man ñnyin ikeme ndibọ Spirit emi Abasi ọkọñwọñọde oto ke mbuọtidem. <verse eid="GAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Nditọ ete, ami ñyom ndida uwutñkpọ kpukpru usen ñwut: Ke ini owo iba edukde ediomi ebaña ñkpọ enyuñ esinde ubọk ke ñwed ediomi, owo ndomokiet ikemeke ndibiat ediomi oro mme ndidian ñkpọ ke esit.<verse eid="GAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Ke emi, Abasi akanam eñwọñọ Esie ọnọ Ebraham ye oruk esie. Ñwed Abasi idọhọke ite, “ye mme oruk fo,” emi ọwọrọde ediwak owo, edi Enye ọdọhọ ete, “ye oruk fo,” emi ọwọrọde owo kiet kpọt kpọt, emi edide Kraist. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Se ami ntiñde edi ntem, Abasi amanam ediomi ye Ebraham onyuñ ọñwọñọ ndinim ediomi emi. Ibet Moses ekenọde ke isua ikie inañ ye edip ye duop ama ekebe, ikemeke ndibiat ediomi oro ñnyuñ mmen eñwọñọ Abasi mfep. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Koro edieke se Abasi ọnọde ọkọñọde ke ibet Moses, ke ntre ikemeke aba ndikọñọ ke eñwọñọ Esie. Nte ededi, ekedi ke ntak eñwọñọ Esie akanam Abasi ọnọ Ebraham enọ oro.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Nso ikedi ntak ibet Moses ndien? Ekedian man owut se idiọkñkpọ edide, ndien akana enye ada tutu ubon Ebraham oro edi, emi ekenamde eñwọñọ oro enọ. Ekenọ ibet eto ubọk mme enjel, ye owo nte esine ufọt. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Owo iyomke esine ufọt, kadaña ini nte edide owo kiet odu, ndien Abasi edi kiet.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Nte emi ọwọrọ ete ke ibet Moses akatuaha ye mme eñwọñọ Abasi? Baba o! Koro edieke ubon owo ọkpọbọde ibet emi ekemede ndinọ uwem, kpukpru owo ekpekeme ndinen iso ye Abasi oto ke edisuk ibuot nnọ utọ ibet oro. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Edi ñwed Abasi ọdọhọ ete ke ofuri ererimbot esine ke idak ukara idiọkñkpọ, ke ntre enọ emi ekeñwọñọde ndinọ owo nto ke edibuọt idem ye Jisọs Kraist emenọ mme mmọ emi enimde ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Mbemiso mbuọtidem edidi, ibet ekesin ñnyin ke ufin nte mbio ñkpọkọbi, tutu eyarade mbuọtidem.<verse eid="GAL 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ke ntre ibet akakara ñnyin tutu Kraist edidi; man oto do enam ñnyin inen ye Abasi oto ke mbuọtidem. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Idahaemi ini mbuọtidem ama ekesim, ibet ikarake aba ñnyin. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Oto ke mbuọtidem ke kpukpru mbufo ekabade edi nditọ Abasi emi enyenede ebuana ye Kraist Jisọs. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Mbufo ekena babtisim ediana kiet ye Kraist, ndien kemi ema emen nti uwem Kraist ke idem esie esine mbufo nte ewura. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Ke ntem, ukpuhọde iduhọ ke ufọt mme Ju ye mme mmọ emi midighe Ju, ke ufọt ifin ye eyen, ke ufọt iren ye iban, mbufo kpukpru edi kiet ke ebuana ye Kraist Jisọs. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Edieke afo edide eke Kraist, afo oto ke ubon Ebraham, ndien afo eyenyuñ ọbọ se Abasi ọkọñwọñọde.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Ke ndika iso, eyen emi edidiade akpa ete esie esikama enye ukem nte ofin kini enye edide ekpri eyen okposuk edi nte edide enye enyene kpukpru ñkpọ oro. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Ke ini enye edide eyenọwọñ mme owo edu emi ekamade enye enyuñ ese enyin ke mme ñkpọ esie tutu ini ete esie okodoride ekem.<verse eid="GAL 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasi Ekedep Ubọhọ Ñnyin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Ke ukem usuñ oro, ñnyin ñko ikedi ifin inọ mme spirit emi akakarade enyọñ ye isọñ, mbemiso ñnyin ikesim idaha nsọñidem ke ñkpọ Spirit. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Edi ke ñkem ñkem ini, Abasi ama osio Eyen Esie ọdọñ. Enye ekedi nte eyen emi eka obukidem amande, onyuñ odu uwem ke idak ibet mme Ju, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />man Enye afak mme mmọ emi ekedude ke idak ibet, man ñnyin idi nditọ Abasi. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Man owut nte ke mbufo edi mme nditọ Esie, Abasi ama ọdọñ Spirit Eyen Esie ediduk ke esit ñnyin, Spirit emi ofioride ete “Ete, Ete mi.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Ke ntre afo udighe aba ofin, edidi eyen. Ndien sia afo edide eyen Esie, Abasi eyenọ fi kpukpru se enye enyenede ọnọ nditọ Esie.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Ke ini emi ekebede mbufo ikọdiọñọke Abasi, ndien ke ntre mbufo ekedi ifin enọ mme ñkpri abasi emi midighe Abasi. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Edi ke emi mbufo ema ekediọñọ Abasi, ñkpakam ndọhọ nte, idahaemi Abasi ama ọkọdiọñọ mbufo, didie ndien ke mbufo eyom ndifiak ñwọñọde ntiene mme mmeme ye mme mbiara spirit ukara? Ntaha mbufo eyomde nditọñọ ntak ndi ifin mmọ-o? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mbufo eka iso ndikpeme mme asaña asaña usen, ye ọfiọñ, ye ini, ye isua. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ami mokop mfina eti eti kabaña mbufo! Nte emi ọwọrọ ete ke kpukpru utom mi ke otu mbufo ọwọrọ ikpuikpu?<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Ami mekpe mbufo ubọk, nditọ ete mi, etie nte ami. Ke editim ntiñ ami ntie nte mbufo. Mbufo inamke mi ndomo idiọkñkpọ kiet. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Mbufo emeti ntak emi ami ñkọkwọrọde Eti Mbuk emi nnọ mbufo ke akpa ini; ekedi koro ami ñkọdọñọde. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Edi mbufo ikesinke mi ke ndek ikinyuñ isinke mi, okposuk edi nte ikpọkidem mi ekedide akamba ñkpọ idomo ọnọ mbufo. Edi mbufo ema edara mi nte mbufo ekpedarade Enjel Abasi. Ema edara mi kpa nte ekpedarade Kraist.<verse eid="GAL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Mbufo ema ekop inemesit! Nso itibe ye mbufo idahaemi? Ami ke idem mi mekeme nditiñ nte, ke mbufo ema ebeñe idem ndisio ñkpasip enyin mbufo, edieke mbufo ekpekemede, ndien emen mmọ enọ mi.<verse eid="GAL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Nte ami makabade ndi owo usua mbufo ke editiñ akpanikọ nnọ mbufo?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Mme mmọ eken oro eñwana ndinam nte ke imikere ibaña mbufo eti eti, edi uduak mmọ ye mbufo ifọnke. Kpukpru se mmọ eyomde edi ndidiañade mbufo ye ami, man oto do mbufo enyene mbubehe ye mmọ kpa nte mmọ enyenede ye mbufo. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Ke emi, ọfọn ndinyene ekikere mbaña owo ke eti ntak, ye ndinyuñ nnam ntre kpukpru ini, idighe ke ini emi ami ndude mi ye mbufo ikpọñ. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Mme ndima nditọ mi, ini kiet efen, kpa nte eka odude ke ubiak uman, ami ñkop ukem ubiak oro kabaña mbufo, tutu edu uwem Kraist ọbọrọ ke esit mbufo. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ọdọñ mi nte ñkpodude ye mbufo ke emi, man oto do ami ñkpuhọde edu mi kabaña mbufo. Ami mokop mfina eti eti kabaña mbufo.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Eyak mbup mbufo oro eyomde ndidu ke idak ibet Moses: nte mbufo ikopke se ibet ọdọhọde? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Ibet ọdọhọ ete ke Ebraham ekenyene nditọ iren iba, ekenyene kiet oto ñwan ofin, enye eken enye ekenyene oto amana isọñ. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Eyen emi enye ekenyenede oto ñwan ofin akamana nte kpukpru owo esimanade, edi eyen emi enye ekenyenede oto amana isọñ añwan akamana oto eñwọñọ Abasi.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ekeme ndida emi nte uwutñkpọ: iban iba emi eda enọ mme ediomi iba. Enye emi nditọ esie emanade ke ufin edi Haga, ndien enye ada ọnọ ediomi emi ekenamde ke obot Sainai. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Haga ada ọnọ akwa obot Sainai ke idut Arabia, ndien enye edi uwutñkpọ akwa obio Jerusalem idahaemi, emi odude ke ufin ye kpukpru ikọt esie. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Edi Jerusalem enye emi otode enyọñ iduhọ ke ufin, ndien enye edi eka ñnyin.<verse eid="GAL 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Koro ñwed Abasi ọdọhọ, ete, “Du ke idara, afo ada añwan, sio ñkpo idara afo emi akananam mukopke ubiak uman! Koro eyenañwan emi ekesinde eyenyene nditọ awak akan ñwan emi akananam ebe esie mikpọñke enye.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Ke emi nditọ ete mi, mbufo edi nditọ Abasi oto ke eñwọñọ Esie, kpa nte Aisik ekedide. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ke ini oro eyen emi akamanade nte kpukpru owo emanade ama ọkọbọ enye emi akamanade oto Spirit Abasi; ndien edi kpa ntre ke emi.<verse eid="GAL 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Edi ñwed Abasi ọdọhọ didie? Enye ọdọhọ, ete, “Bin eyenañwan ofin ye eyen esie, koro eyen añwan ofin ikemeke ndibuana unen udeme ke ñkpọ ete ye enyemi amanaisọñ añwan amande”. <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Ke ntre nditọ ete mi, ñnyin idighe nditọ añwan ofin, edi, idi eke amanaisọñ añwan.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kraist Anam Ñnyin Ibọhọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Uwọrọ ufin edi se ñnyin inyenede, Kraist osio ñnyin ke ufin! Esọñọ eda nte mme mmọ emi ema ekewọrọ ufin, ekuyak idem mbufo efiak esin ke ufin. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Ekpañ utọñ! Ami Pọl ntiñ emi nnọ mbufo nte edieke eyakde enim mbufo mbobi, oro ọwọrọ ete ke Kraist inyeneke ufọn inọ kpukpru mbufo. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Inikiet efen ke ami nduri owo kiet ekededi utọñ, emi ediyakde idem esie inọ enim enye mbobi nte ke ana enye enim kpukpru ibet. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Mbufo oro eñwanade ndinen ke iso Abasi nto ke edinim ibet emesibe idem mbufo ekpọñ Kraist. Mbufo emewọrọ ekpọñ mfọn Abasi.<verse eid="GAL 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Edi ama edi ñnyin, idorenyin edi ke Abasi eyenam ñnyin inen ke iso Esie; ndien emi edi se ñnyin isuk ibetde ke odudu Spirit Abasi emi adade mbuọtidem ñnyin esin ke edinam. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Koro ke ini ñnyin idianade kiet ye Kraist Jisọs, edina mbobi mme unana edina mbobi inamke ukpuhọde ndomokiet, ke usuñ ndomokiet; edi se idide akpan ñkpọ do edi mbuọtidem emi asañade ye ima anam utom.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Mbufo ema enam ọfọn. Anie enam mbufo etre ndisuk ibuot nnọ akpanikọ? Didie ke enye akatap mbufo? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Ikedighe Abasi emi okotde mbufo akanam. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Mme owo etiñ ete, “Ekpri esisit ibọk unam uyo anam ofuri ndom unam uyo emi ema ekebuak ọtọt”.<verse eid="GAL 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Edi ami ke ñyenyene idorenyin ke idem mbufo. Ebuana ñnyin ke Ọbọñ anam mi nnim ke akpanikọ nte ke mbufo idinyeneke ekikere efen, ndien owo emi añwanade nditimede mbufo, se enye ekpededi, eyebọ utib edinam esie.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Edi ama edi ami, nditọ ete, ntak ukọbọ osuk ọkọbọde mi edieke ami ñkade iso ndikwọrọ nte ke ana mbufo ena mbobi? Edieke oro ekpedide akpanikọ, edikwọrọ mbaña Krọs Kraist ikpedaha mfina ndomokiet idi. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Edi udọñ mi nte mme mmọ oro etimerede mbufo ekpekam enam ewut ofuri ofuri ke edinam idem mmọ itọ. <verse eid="GAL 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Ama edi mbufo nditọ ete mi; ekekot mbufo esioño ke ufin. Edi ekuyak Uwọrọ ufin emi edi ntak emi mbufo edade idem mbufo enam se idọñde obukidem mbufo itọñ. Utu ke oro, eyak ima anam mbufo enam ñkpọ enọ kiet eken. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Koro efut ofuri mme ibet esin ke ewuhọ kiet: “Ma mbọhọiduñ fo nte afo amade idem fo”. <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Edi, edieke mbufo enamde ñkpọ nte mme unam ikọt enamde kiet eken ñkpọ ubiak, enyuñ enọ kiet eken unan, ekpeme, ke midighe ntre mbufo eyesobo idem mbufo.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiene Edisana Spirit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Se ami ñketiñde edi ntem: eyak Spirit ada mbufo usuñ ke uwem emi, ndien mbufo idinuhọke inọ itọñ obukidem mbufo. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Koro se obukidem ñnyin oyomde atuaha ye se Spirit oyomde, ndien se Spirit oyomde atuaha ye se obukidem oyomde. Mbiba edi mbon usua, emi ọwọrọde ete ke mbufo ikemeke ndinam se mbufo ekpemade ndinam emi edide eti. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Edieke Spirit adade mbufo usuñ mbufo iduhọ ke idak ibet Moses.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Se obukidem idiọkñkpọ anamde ana añwa añwa. Enye ọwọrọ owut idem esie ke use, efibe, mbubiam ido, obukpo ido, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />edikpono ndem ye ifọt. Usua ye kiet eken, eñwan, idiọk ufup, obom obom esit, utọk, ndomo idem, ubahade, ntiense edem, etabi, ye editiñ ntime ntime ikọ mbaña Abasi ye utom esie ye edisiak isio ñka. <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />Udu, uwot owo, ukpammin, mme mbubiam ñka inemesit, ye mme ñkpọ eken eke ebietde mme mmọ emi. Ami moduri mbufo utọñ nte mma ñkododuri akpa nte, mme mmọ emi enamde mme ñkpọ emi idinyeneke udeme ke obio ubọñ Abasi.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Edi mme mfri Spirit edi ima, idara, emem, ime, mfọnido, eti ido, edinam akpanikọ, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />nsuhọde idem, mfarakeidem. Ibet ndomokiet ituahake ye mme oruk nti mfri ntem.<verse eid="GAL 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Ndien mme mmọ emi edide eke Kraist Jisọs ema ewot obukidem ye kpukpru mme idiọk udọñ esie.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Spirit ama ọnọ ñnyin uwem, enye ñko enyene ndikara uwem ñnyin. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Ñnyin inyeneke ndidi mbon ntañidem, mme ndiyat kiet eken esit, mme ndifube kiet eken.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Mme nditọ ete mi, edieke emumde owo ndomokiet ke idiọkñkpọ, mbufo emi esọñde idem ke Spirit eneñede enye enim; edi enyene ndinam emi ke ifure ifure usuñ. Ndien ekpeme idem mbufo, man idomo edidomo mbufo ñko. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Eñwam ndibiom mbiomo kiet eken, ndien ke usuñ emi ke mbufo edinam se ibet Kraist oyomde. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Edieke owo ndomokiet ekerede ete ke imọ idi ñkpọ, ke ini enye midighe ñkpọ ndomokiet, ke akpanikọ, enye ada idem esie anam ndisime. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Owo kiet kiet enyene ndiduñọde edinam esie nse. Edieke ọfọnde, do ndien ke enye ekeme ndien nditaña ase ke se enye ke idem esie ama akanam, idighe ndimen ñkodomo ye se owo efen ama akanam. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Koro owo kiet kiet enyene ndibiom mbiomo esie.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Owo emi ọbọde ukpepñkpọ oto ikọ Abasi, enyene ndibuana kpukpru nti ñkpọ emi enye enyenede ye andikpep esie.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyak Idem Emem Fi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Kubiaña idem fo: koro owo baba kiet ikemeke ndida Abasi nnam ndisime. Owo edidọk ukem ukem se enye ọkọtọde. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Edieke enye ọkọtọde ke iñwañ inemesit idem esie, enye eyedọk idọk ñkpa oto ke esit, edi edieke enye ọtọde ke iñwañ Spirit, enye eyedọk idọk nsinsi uwem oto ke Spirit. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Do, ekuyak ñnyin ikpa mba ke edinam nti ñkpọ; koro edieke ñnyin mikpaha mba, ini eyedi emi ñnyin ididọkde idọk esie. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Ke ntre, adaña nte ñnyin inyenyene ifet, eyak ñnyin inam eti ñkpọ inọ owo kiet ekededi, akpanakpan ye mme mmọ emi edide kiet ye ñnyin ke ekpuk mbuọtidem.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Ese ikpọ ubọk ñwed emi ami ndade ñwet ñwed emi ke idem mi nnọ esọk mbufo. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Mme mmọ oro eyomde ndiwut idem ñnyuñ ñkpọ inua mbaña mme enyọñ enyọñ ñkpọ edi mme mmọ oro eñwanade ndinyik mbufo ena mbobi. Mmọ enam emi man otodo ukọbọ okusim mmọ kabaña Krọs Kraist. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Kpa ye idem mme mmọ oro enade mbobi isukke ibuot inọ ibet; mmọ eyom mbufo ena mbobi man mmọ eda etaña ase nte ke mbufo ema esuk ibuot enọ edinam obukidem emi.<verse eid="GAL 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ama edi ami, ke usuñ kiet ekededi, ami ndibure mbure ke ntak Krọs Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist ikpọñ ikpọñ, koro edi ke ntak Krọs Esie, ererimbot ama akpa ọnọ mi, ami ñko ñnyuñ ñkpa nnọ ererimbot. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Edina mbobi ye editre ndina mbobi iwọrọke ñkpọ ndomokiet; se idide akpan ñkpọ do edi, ndikabade ndi obufa obot. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Yak emem ye mbọm etiene kpukpru mme mmọ emi etienede mme item emi ke uwem mmọ ye kpukpru mme ikọt Abasi. <verse eid="GAL 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Ke akpatre: Yak owo baba kiet okufina mi aba, koro mme nde inia unan emi ñnyenede ke idem mi owut ete ke ami ndi ofin Jisọs.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Yak mfọn Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist odu ye Spirit mbufo kpukpru nditọ ete mi.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>